```c
if(ctx->streaming)
{
    len = SPNG_READ_SIZE;
    if(len > ctx->current_chunk.length) len = ctx->current_chunk.length;
}
else len = ctx->current_chunk.length;
```

But `ctx->current_chunk.length` is `uint32_t`. And `len` is also `uint32_t`. So no truncation.

